  "description": "WONKER crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 4/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H71 F11 N2 O40 Tb6. From the CIF bond table, Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.912-3.927 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 113.21-113.89°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links.",
